  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "scene": "hide_truck",
   "start": 6.51,
   "speech_end": 10.44,
   "end": 11.44,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "Then you wait. Engines on the highway. Getting closer.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "scene": "hide_truck",
   "start": 11.44,
   "speech_end": 14.97,
   "end": 15.97,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "The ice machine hums. It's the only sound at the Starlight.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "scene": "shed_psst",
   "start": 15.97,
   "speech_end": 18.37,
   "end": 19.37,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "Psst. Gas station. Over here.",
   "role": "milo"
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "scene": "shed_in",
   "start": 19.37,
   "speech_end": 20.26,
   "end": 21.26,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "Get in. Quiet.",
   "role": "dani_live"
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "scene": "shed_in",
   "start": 21.26,
   "speech_end": 26.22,
   "end": 27.42,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "Dani is seventeen. Milo is nine. They've been in this shed since the knock.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "scene": "dani_close",
   "start": 27.42,
   "speech_end": 32.73,
   "end": 33.73,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "When the man in the vest knocked, we went out the bathroom window. He didn't follow. He just stood there.",
   "role": "dani_live"
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "scene": "dani_close",
   "start": 33.73,
   "speech_end": 39.41,
   "end": 40.41,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "That recording isn't us. Not anymore. They made me say it, two nights ago.",
   "role": "dani_live"
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "scene": "you_close",
   "start": 40.41,
   "speech_end": 40.9,
   "end": 41.9,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "They?",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "scene": "dani_close",
   "start": 41.9,
   "speech_end": 44.58,
   "end": 45.38,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "Dani glances at the parking lot, like it might be listening.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "scene": "dani_close",
   "start": 45.38,
   "speech_end": 49.53,
   "end": 50.33,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "The Linemen. Utility crews. Hard hats, floodlights, big trucks.",
   "role": "dani_live"
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "scene": "herding",
   "start": 50.33,
   "speech_end": 53.56,
   "end": 54.96,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "They use lights like a sheepdog. They move them. Whole crowds.",
   "role": "dani_live"
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "scene": "milo_close",
   "start": 54.96,
   "speech_end": 60.5,
   "end": 61.5,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "They took Mrs. Alvarez. And the man from room four. They said they were going to the dam.",
   "role": "milo"
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "scene": "dam_map",
   "start": 61.5,
   "speech_end": 63.75,
   "end": 64.75,
   "overlay": [
    "count",
    "20",
    "MILES TO HARLAN DAM"
   ],
   "text": "Harlan Dam. The lights there never go off.",
   "role": "dani_live"
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "scene": "shed_dark",
   "start": 64.75,
   "speech_end": 68.62,
   "end": 70.02,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "A place that's always lit. In a world where light means death.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "scene": "floodlights",
   "start": 70.02,
   "speech_end": 71.89,
   "end": 72.69,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "Then the floodlights reach the parking lot.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "scene": "floodlights",
   "start": 72.69,
   "speech_end": 78.18,
   "end": 79.38,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "White light. Brighter than day. It slides across every door, one by one.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "scene": "slats",
   "start": 79.38,
   "speech_end": 82.66,
   "end": 84.26,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "Light pours through the slats. You all lie flat.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "scene": "boone_out",
   "start": 84.26,
   "speech_end": 88.71,
   "end": 89.71,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "Gas station! I know you're here. Your truck's still warm.",
   "role": "boone_mega"
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "scene": "boone_out",
   "start": 89.71,
   "speech_end": 97.86,
   "end": 99.06,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "Nobody's getting hurt tonight. We've got food. Water. Walls. Come on out.",
   "role": "boone_mega"
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "scene": "shed_scared",
   "start": 99.06,
   "speech_end": 102.53,
   "end": 103.53,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "Dani shakes her head. Milo is shaking all over.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "scene": "trucks_crowd",
   "start": 103.53,
   "speech_end": 111.02,
   "end": 112.42,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "Through the slats you count the trucks. Four. And behind each one, a crowd of the dead, walking calmly in its light.",
